						 <p>WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT? I ALWAYS TALK LIKE THIS! YOU HAVE SOME NERVE TO IMPLY THAT I- <strong>*CRACK</strong>*</p> <p>Sorry about that, seems I forgot to get rid of all the duplicates after messing round with [[SCP-715]]. I just wanted to remidnd staff that SCP-014-J is not to be treated lightly. Need I remind you that, last time SCP-014-J breached containment, it killed over ███,███ personell, including Dr. M███, O-5█, SCPs-███, ███, and ████ Dr. Bright (again), Santa Claus, Mr. $%$#B^UTjvm30v4t-=0 miv340-tiii8604.</p> <p><em>Disregard that last paragraph, it seems a weaponized strain of SCP-732 has found it's way onto my hard drive.<br /> -Dr. Edison<br /></em></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
